cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>105 cm / 41.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>105 cm / 41.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-69.5 kg / 139-153 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Ivory Dot Mommy and Me Dresses are made for sunlit getaways, family photos, and slow summer afternoons. The lightweight woven fabric keeps the look airy, while the ruched bodice, square neckline, and tiny black dots give both mom and mini a polished, playful silhouette.</p>\n\n<p>From birthday brunches to vacation dinners, this matching puff-sleeve dress set feels sweet without losing its easy charm. The ivory-and-black palette keeps styling simple, and the gathered midi skirt pairs just as easily with ballet flats and bows as it does with woven bags and family snapshots.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy woven feel:</strong> Lightweight polyester keeps the silhouette easy and warm-weather friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Square neckline:</strong> A clean neckline frames the dotted bodice with a polished vintage-inspired shape.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Petite puff sleeves:</strong> Soft shoulder volume keeps the silhouette sweet and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ruched bodice:</strong> Gentle front ruching adds texture while keeping the fit relaxed and wearable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home a dotted ivory matching dress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Black","Child 1-2yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dots","Dresses","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1042309825160.html?","Ivory","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family 